# Portfolio styling sync

This app uses **GitHub Pages** static export. **`prodBasePath`** in **`next.config.mjs`** is the production URL prefix (empty string = site at **custom domain root**, e.g. **https://designbeanies.com/**). **`next dev`** sets **`basePath: ""`** so the site runs at **`http://localhost:3000/`** and JS/CSS hydrate reliably.

## Do not regress dev CSS

- **`output: "export"`** must be enabled **only** when `next build` runs (e.g. `process.argv.includes("build")`). Gating on **`NODE_ENV === "production"`** alone breaks **`next dev`**: the dev server can look unstyled because CSS/`_next` chunks fail to load.
- **`scripts/dev.mjs`** must keep **`NODE_ENV: "development"`** for the child `next dev` process so a stray production env never triggers export mode during local dev.

## What `npm run verify` does / does not do

- **`npm run verify:styling`** only inspects **`out/`** after **`npm run build`** (exported CSS + HTML link). It does **not** hit **`next dev`** or port 3000 — broken local dev will not fail that check.

## After changing `next.config.mjs`, Tailwind, PostCSS, or app layout/CSS imports

- Run **`npm run verify`** (lint + build + styling checks) before merging.
- If local dev looks unstyled or clicks do nothing: **`rm -rf .next`**, then **`npm run dev`**, open the printed URL (**root `/`** in dev), and confirm **`/_next/static/css/*.css`** returns **200** in the Network tab.

## Paths and assets

- Prefer **`NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH`** or **`prodBasePath`** / **`basePath`** in **`next.config.mjs`** for URLs and `publicPath()` — production uses **`prodBasePath`** (may be empty); dev uses an empty prefix.

## GitHub Pages artifact (`post-export-basepath-symlink.mjs`)

- **Local** builds: if **`prodBasePath`** is non-empty, a symlink **`out/<segment>` → `out`** is created so **`npm run preview`** (`serve out`) resolves **`/<segment>/_next/...`** URLs. If **`prodBasePath`** is **empty**, the script **skips** the symlink (site at domain root; **`serve out`** uses **`/_next/...`** directly).
- **CI** (`CI=true`) **skips** that symlink — Pages serves **`out/`** at the site root or project path; a self-referential symlink breaks **`upload-pages-artifact`** (runaway archive).

## Typography tokens

- Scale lives in **`src/lib/typography.ts`**; full reference in **`docs/typography.md`**.
- **`tailwind.config.ts`** `content` must include **`./src/lib/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}`** so token utilities (e.g. `text-[32px]`) are emitted. Missing that path makes headings render at body size (~16px).
- **When adding new UI:** use an existing token or add one in `typography.ts`, update `docs/typography.md`, then run **`npm run verify`**. Do not inline `text-[Npx]` for copy.
